======================================================================
🎉 React Loop Skills - Local Server (Simple Mode)
======================================================================

📍 Server running on http://localhost:3001

📚 Available endpoints:
  GET  /health                          - Health check
  GET  /skills                          - List all skills
  POST /farmers/:id/chat/session        - Create chat session
  POST /farmers/:id/chat/turn           - Send chat message ⭐
  GET  /farmers/:id                     - Get farmer data
  GET  /farmers/:id/animals             - Get animals
  GET  /farmers/:id/appointments        - Get appointments

🧪 Test commands:
  curl http://localhost:3001/health
  curl http://localhost:3001/skills
  curl http://localhost:3001/farmers/farmer_001

  # Create session and chat
  curl -X POST http://localhost:3001/farmers/farmer_001/chat/session
  curl -X POST http://localhost:3001/farmers/farmer_001/chat/turn

  # Test intent persistence (fragments):
  curl -X POST http://localhost:3001/farmers/farmer_001/chat/turn
  curl -X POST http://localhost:3001/farmers/farmer_001/chat/turn

